<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"/>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Boise Gems Drum & Bugle Corps</title>
  <%- include("includes/head") %>
  <meta name="description" content="The Boise Gems Drum & Bugle Corps — Idaho’s summer marching program. Learn the history, season details, and how to join.">
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://boisegems.org/corps">
  <meta property="og:title" content="Boise Gems Drum & Bugle Corps">
  <meta property="og:description" content="Idaho’s summer marching program. History, season info, auditions, and more.">
</head>
<body style="background: #eee">
  <header><%- include("includes/header") %></header>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section style="padding:16px 12px;">
    <div class="duple-to-single" style="align-items:center; gap:16px;">
      <div style="margin:4px;">
        <h1>Boise Gems Drum & Bugle Corps</h1>
        <p style="max-width:60ch;">
          Founded to bring world-class marching arts to Idaho, the Boise Gems Drum & Bugle Corps
          performs across the region every summer. Our members rehearse, travel, and compete
          while building lifelong friendships, musical excellence, and competitive grit.
        </p>
        <div style="display:flex; gap:8px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-top:12px;">
          <a href="/register-member"><button>Audition / Join</button></a>
          <a href="/calendar"><button>Season Schedule</button></a>
          <a href="/donate"><button>Donate</button></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="margin:4px;">
        <!-- Placeholder image (16:9) -->
        <div style="width:100%; aspect-ratio:16/9; background:#eee; background-image:url('/img/action/indexHero.jpg'); background-size:cover; background-position:center; border-radius:8px;"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- HISTORY -->
  <section style="padding:16px 12px;">
    <div class="duple-to-single" style="gap:16px;">
      <div style="margin:4px;">
        <h2>Our Story</h2>
        <p style="max-width:65ch;">
          The Boise Gems began with a small group of educators, alumni, and community supporters
          who believed Idaho deserved a competitive, community-rooted drum corps experience.
          Since those early rehearsals, the corps has grown into a summer home for performers
          across the Northwest—performing field shows, parades, and community exhibitions.
        </p>
        <p style="max-width:65ch;">
          We focus on strong fundamentals, a supportive culture, and shows that audiences love.
          Whether it’s brass power chords under stadium lights or drumline beats echoing downtown,
          the Gems bring a uniquely Idaho voice to the marching arts.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin:4px;">
        <div style="width:100%; aspect-ratio:4/3; background:#eee; background-image:url('/img/photos/boise-gems-01.jpg'); background-size:cover; background-position:center; border-radius:8px;"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHAT TO EXPECT -->
  <section style="padding:16px 12px;">
    <h2>Summer Season — What to Expect</h2>
    <div class="triple-to-single triple-to-single-mod" style="gap:12px;">
      <div class="card" style="margin:4px;">
        <div style="width:100%; aspect-ratio:3/2; background:#eee; background-image:url('/img/photos/show-18.jpg'); background-size:cover; background-position:center; border-radius:6px;"></div>
        <h3 style="margin-top:8px;">Rehearsals</h3>
        <p>Weekend and camp-style rehearsals build fundamentals and show content efficiently.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card" style="margin:4px;">
        <div style="width:100%; aspect-ratio:3/2; background:#eee; background-image:url('/img/photos/boise-gems-11.jpg'); background-size:cover; background-position:center; border-radius:6px;"></div>
        <h3 style="margin-top:8px;">Travel & Performances</h3>
        <p>Regional shows, parades, and exhibitions across Idaho and neighboring states.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card" style="margin:4px;">
        <div style="width:100%; aspect-ratio:3/2; background:#eee; background-image:url('/img/photos/community.jpg'); background-size:cover; background-position:center; border-radius:6px;"></div>
        <h3 style="margin-top:8px;">Community</h3>
        <p>A supportive culture focused on growth, accountability, and having a blast together.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CALL TO ACTION -->
  <section style="padding:16px 12px;">
    <div class="card" style="padding:16px;">
      <h2 style="margin:0 0 8px;">Ready to Perform?</h2>
      <p style="margin:0 0 12px;">Audition materials are updated regularly. Start your Gems journey today.</p>
      <div style="display:flex; gap:8px; flex-wrap:wrap;">
        <a href="/register-member"><button>Create a Free Account</button></a>
        <a href="/contact"><button>Contact Staff</button></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer><%- include("includes/footer") %></footer>
</body>
</html>
